-through the chokepoint or escalate a retirement for a human. At Stop the
+through the chokepoint or escalate a retirement for a human. Each tool a
+lint totality oracle names runs once, on the written files it lints (oxlint
+the JavaScript and TypeScript kinds, ruff Python), within 20 s so a slow one
+never outlasts the host's hook timeout. A finding is printed the same way:
+the invariant, the site with the tool's message, and the two honest options,
+change the site so the rule no longer reports it or escalate a retirement. A
+clean file, a file in the listed residual, and a file no linter reads say
+nothing. That check appends no run, because the written files are not the
+set the totality oracle is total over; `run` records its verdict. At Stop the
 regulation message carries the structural defects the latest run left; at
 SubagentStop one refuses the stop.
